# New repository policy: LF everywhere in the working tree, on every OS.
# Prettier, content digests and offline resource graphs then see identical bytes on Windows and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets and vendored SDK tarballs must never be normalised.
*.tgz binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary